212
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:19,040
If a manufacturer wants to earn the society's certification,

213
00:12:19,041 --> 00:12:21,380
General Motors does this on a voluntary basis.

214
00:12:21,381 --> 00:12:22,680
How are you doing?

215
00:12:22,681 --> 00:12:23,540
How are you doing, Jerry?

216
00:12:23,541 --> 00:12:24,480
Pretty good.

