221
00:12:34,681 --> 00:12:38,900
With everything in place, this all important test begins.

222
00:12:38,901 --> 00:12:40,400
Everything looks pretty good, and we're

223
00:12:40,401 --> 00:12:41,200
ready to start the test.

224
00:12:41,201 --> 00:12:42,200
Let's go.

225
00:12:42,201 --> 00:12:49,200
Only a few minutes into the test, technicians detect a problem and

226
00:12:49,201 --> 00:12:51,200
