248
00:13:55,960 --> 00:13:56,860
It was a valid test.

249
00:13:56,960 --> 00:13:58,660
All the test parameters were within spec.

250
00:13:58,760 --> 00:14:01,220
We have good horsepower numbers, so it was a valid engine power

251
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,920
test, and we can certify.

252
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:05,560
Thank you very much.

253
00:14:05,561 --> 00:14:08,060
This is just one of the many engines General Motors has

254
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:10,060
