00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:20,600
the sprinkler spins the other way.

597
00:34:20,700 --> 00:34:23,800
And that's identical to a reaction turbine.

598
00:34:23,900 --> 00:34:26,060
A massive steel and copper shaft

